message: "If you use DoECISORY.jl in your research or publications, please cite the software using the metadata below."
title: "DoECISORY.jl: Design of Experiments with Computational Interactive Sequential Optimisation for Response Yield"
abstract: "DoECISORY.jl is an open-source, registered Julia package and stateless Dash web application developed for classical and adaptive Design of Experiments (DoE), Response Surface Methodology (RSM), stoichiometric verification, and multi-objective optimisation."
